{
  "An accordion expands and collapses sections under their headers. It supports one or several open sections, sections that stay open, icons, three appearances and sections that are created when first opened.": "",
  "The children of an `<AccordionItem>` are its section. `value` lists the keys of the open items, and `x-model` provides two-way binding. When you create the component with `new`, add and remove items programmatically.": "",
  "Single and multiple expansion": "",
  "By default, one item is open at a time. With `multiple`, several can be open. `collapsible={false}` keeps one open, so its header cannot close it.": "",
  "Lazy sections": "Tembel bölümler",
  "A section is created when first opened and then kept (`lazy`, on by default). An item with a `content` factory and `keepAlive={false}` has its content disposed when it closes and recreated when it opens.": "",
  "Moves from header to header, and into an open section.": "",
  "Expands or collapses the focused item.": "",
  "Moves to the next or previous header, wrapping at the ends (with `arrowKeys`).": "",
  "Moves to the first or last header (with `arrowKeys`).": "",
  "Moves focus to that header and toggles it (Control + Option + key on Apple platforms).": "",
  "A `<button>` with `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`, inside an element with `role=\"heading\"` and `aria-level` (`headingLevel`).": "`role=\"heading\"` ve `aria-level` (`headingLevel`) taşıyan öğe içinde `aria-expanded` ve `aria-controls` taşıyan `<button>`.",
  "`role=\"region\"` named by its header (`aria-labelledby`) when there are six items or fewer, as the APG recommends. `regions` controls this.": "",
  "`visibility: hidden` once closed, which removes it from the Tab order and the accessibility tree.": "",
  "With `collapsible` off, the header of an item that cannot close has `aria-disabled=\"true\"`.": "",
  "The height animates using the motion tokens, and reduced motion turns it off.": "",
  "The root. `data-variant`, `data-size`, `data-chevron`, `data-disabled`.": "Kök. `data-variant`, `data-size`, `data-chevron`, `data-disabled`.",
  "An item: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`.": "Öğe: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`.",
  "The heading and its button.": "",
  "The parts of a header.": "Başlığın parçaları.",
  "The section (animated) and its content.": "Bölüm (animasyonlu) ve içeriği.",
  "Header sizes, from the density tokens.": "Yoğunluk token'larından başlık boyutları.",
  "Units: the accordion and its items per variant (`list`, `list-next`, `separated`, `flush`; `expanded`).": "Unit'ler: varyanta göre accordion ve öğeleri (`list`, `list-next`, `separated`, `flush`; `expanded`).",
  "Units: a header (`expanded`, `hover`, `pressed`, `disabled`, `focus`), its icon, the chevron (`open`) and the plate behind it, and the open section.": "",
  "The sizes of the chevron and plate, and the spacing above and below the section content.": "",
  "Accordion props": "Accordion prop'ları",
  "The keys of the open items (an item without a key uses its index). `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "Allows several items to be open. Otherwise, opening one closes the other.": "",
  "With `false`, one item stays open, and its header has `aria-disabled` while it cannot close.": "",
  "The `aria-level` of the headers (1 to 6). Match it to the surrounding headings.": "",
  "Up, Down, Home and End move between headers.": "",
  "Sections are `role=\"region\"` landmarks; `auto` while there are six items or fewer.": "Bölümler `role=\"region\"` landmark'larıdır; altı ya da daha az öğe varken `auto`.",
  "`list` (one bordered box), `separated` (a card per item) or `flush` (dividers only).": "",
  "The position of the chevron: `end`, `start` or `none`.": "",
  "Creates a section when first opened and then keeps it. An item's own `lazy` takes precedence.": "",
  "With `false`, content created by an item's `content` is disposed when it closes and recreated when it opens. An item's own `keepAlive` takes precedence.": "",
  "AccordionItem props": "AccordionItem prop'ları",
  "The header text. `&Shipping` makes Alt+S toggle the item. This is the same property as `text`.": "",
  "Identifies the item in `value`. The JSX `key` also works.": "",
  "Indicates whether the section is open.": "",
  "A tooltip on the header.": "Başlıkta bir tooltip.",
  "From Accordion": "",
  "This item's own setting.": "Bu öğenin kendi ayarı.",
  "Creates the section content when it is created, either instead of or after the JSX children.": "",
  "A disabled item cannot be opened or closed, and a hidden item is removed.": "",
  "The items in order.": "",
  "The open items.": "Açık öğeler.",
  "Indicates whether its section has been created.": "",
  "Its `Accordion`, its header button and its region.": "",
  "Adds an item. An item from another `Accordion` moves here.": "",
  "Removes the item and disposes it. Focus inside moves to an adjacent item.": "",
  "Programmatic control. `expandAll` requires `multiple`, and with `collapsible` off one item stays open.": "",
  "Toggles as a click would, so the cancelable events run. `item.expanded = true` sets the state programmatically.": "",
  "Sets focus on the item's header.": "",
  "Occurs before the user opens or closes an item. `e`: `{ item, index, cancel, source, event? }`. Set `e.cancel = true` to keep the current state.": "",
  "Occurs after an item opens or closes. `e`: `{ item, index, byUser, source }`.": "",
  "The accordion has no strings of its own, so it adds nothing to `uiLocale`.": ""
}
